{"version": 2, "width": 80, "height": 24, "timestamp": 1767146332, "env": {"SHELL": "/bin/bash", "TERM": "xterm-256color"}, "title": "Structured Error Handler / serr - Tuulbelt"}
[0.005041, "o", "# Step 1: Install globally\r\n"]
[0.507127, "o", "$ npm link\r\n"]
[1.508519, "o", "\r\n# Step 2: View available commands\r\n"]
[2.009939, "o", "$ serr --help\r\n"]
[3.036292, "o", "Structured Error Handler - Error format with context preservation\r\n\r\nUsage:\r\n  structured-error-handler <command> [options] [input]\r\n\r\nCommands:\r\n  parse <json>     Parse a JSON error and format it\r\n  validate <json>  Validate JSON error format\r\n  demo             Show a demo of structured errors\r\n\r\nOptions:\r\n  -f, --format <format>  Output format: json, text (default: json)\r\n  -s, --stack           Include stack traces in output\r\n  -h, --help            Show this help message\r\n\r\nExamples:\r\n  # Parse and format an error\r\n  structured-error-handler parse '{\"message\":\"test\",\"context\":[]}'\r\n\r\n  # Validate error format\r\n  structured-error-handler validate '{\"message\":\"test\"}'\r\n\r\n  # Show demo\r\n  structured-error-handler demo --format text\r\n"]
[6.051358, "o", "\r\n# Step 3: Interactive demo\r\n"]
[6.552731, "o", "$ serr demo --format text\r\n"]
[7.532277, "o", "[DB_CONNECTION_FAILED] Failed to connect to database\r\n\r\nContext:\r\n  → handleGetUser (UserController) {\"endpoint\":\"/api/users/12345\"}\r\n  → fetchUserProfile (UserService) {\"userId\":\"12345\"}\r\n  → connectToDatabase (DatabaseClient) {\"host\":\"localhost\",\"port\":5432}\r\n\r\nCaused by:\r\n  Connection refused\r\n"]
[10.548016, "o", "\r\n# Step 4: Parse structured error\r\n"]
[11.049427, "o", "$ serr parse '{\"message\":\"File not found\",\"context\":[{\"key\":\"path\",\"value\":\"/tmp/missing.txt\"}]}'\r\n"]
[12.022901, "o", "{\r\n  \"name\": \"StructuredError\",\r\n  \"message\": \"File not found\",\r\n  \"context\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"key\": \"path\",\r\n      \"value\": \"/tmp/missing.txt\"\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"stack\": \"StructuredError: File not found\\n    at Function.fromJSON (/home/runner/work/structured-error-handler/structured-error-handler/src/index.ts:337:19)\\n    at main (/home/runner/work/structured-error-handler/structured-error-handler/src/index.ts:688:39)\\n    at <anonymous> (/home/runner/work/structured-error-handler/structured-error-handler/src/index.ts:739:7)\\n    at ModuleJob.run (node:internal/modules/esm/module_job:325:25)\\n    at async ModuleLoader.import (node:internal/modules/esm/loader:606:24)\\n    at async asyncRunEntryPointWithESMLoader (node:internal/modules/run_main:117:5)\"\r\n}\r\n"]
[14.03811, "o", "\r\n# Step 5: Validate error format\r\n"]
[14.539566, "o", "$ serr validate '{\"message\":\"Valid error\"}'\r\n"]
[14.994347, "o", "Valid error format\r\n"]
[16.009711, "o", "$ serr validate '{\"invalid\":\"structure\"}'\r\n"]
[16.475031, "o", "Invalid error format: missing required \"message\" field\r\n"]
[16.488841, "o", "✓ Validation caught invalid format\r\n"]
[18.490131, "o", "\r\n# Step 6: JSON output\r\n"]
[18.991557, "o", "$ serr demo --format json\r\n"]
[19.959165, "o", "{\r\n  \"name\": \"StructuredError\",\r\n  \"message\": \"Failed to connect to database\",\r\n  \"context\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"operation\": \"handleGetUser\",\r\n      \"component\": \"UserController\",\r\n      \"metadata\": {\r\n        \"endpoint\": \"/api/users/12345\"\r\n      },\r\n      \"timestamp\": \"2025-12-31T01:59:12.505Z\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"operation\": \"fetchUserProfile\",\r\n      \"component\": \"UserService\",\r\n      \"metadata\": {\r\n        \"userId\": \"12345\"\r\n      },\r\n      \"timestamp\": \"2025-12-31T01:59:12.502Z\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"operation\": \"connectToDatabase\",\r\n      \"component\": \"DatabaseClient\",\r\n      \"metadata\": {\r\n        \"host\": \"localhost\",\r\n        \"port\": 5432\r\n      },\r\n      \"timestamp\": \"2025-12-31T01:59:12.502Z\"\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"code\": \"DB_CONNECTION_FAILED\",\r\n  \"category\": \"database\",\r\n  \"stack\": \"StructuredError: Failed to connect to database\\n    at Function.wrap (/home/runner/work/structured-error-handler/structured-error-handler/src/index.ts:195:12)\\n    at runDemo (/home/runner/work/structured-error-handler/structured-error-handler/src/index.ts:638:35)\\n    at main (/home/runner/work/structured-error-handler/structured-error-handler/src/index.ts:677:7)\\n    at <anonymous> (/home/runner/work/structured-error-handler/structured-error-handler/src/index.ts:739:7)\\n    at ModuleJob.run (node:internal/modules/esm/module_job:325:25)\\n    at async ModuleLoader.import (node:internal/modules/esm/loader:606:24)\\n    at async asyncRunEntryPointWithESMLoader (node:internal/modules/run_main:117:5)\",\r\n  \"cause\": {\r\n    \"name\": \"Error\",\r\n    \"message\": \"Connection refused\",\r\n    \"context\": [],\r\n    \"stack\": \"Error: Connection refused\\n    at runDemo (/home/runner/work/structured-error-handler/structured-error-handler/src/index.ts:636:21)\\n    at main (/home/runner/work/structured-error-handler/structured-error-handler/src/index.ts:677:7)\\n    at <anonymous> (/home/runner/work/structured-error-handler/structured-error-handler/src/index.ts:739:7)\\n    at ModuleJob.run (node:internal/modules/esm/module_job:325:25)\\n    at async ModuleLoader.import (node:internal/modules/esm/loader:606:24)\\n    at async asyncRunEntryPointWithESMLoader (node:internal/modules/run_main:117:5)\"\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n"]
[21.974086, "o", "\r\n# Done! Handle errors with: serr parse <error-json>\r\n"]
